# Cursor execution adapter

Root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) owns permissions, Git, quality and implementation/acceptance split. Read selected CHANGE.md, TASKS dispatch index and [parent policy](../../.agents/references/bounded-parent-orchestration.md), not all planner files.

**Commission:** one Change and one preferred measurable outcome. Seven actual tasks, including nested assignments, is a strong default. Target 5–10 minutes of active implementation. [Submission standard](../../.agents/references/planning-artifact-quality.md) and [severity](../../AGENTS.md#finding-severity-and-blocking). Return a newly commissioned packet that is incoherent, unsafe or forces architectural invention, and name the exact gap. A count or size signal alone is not that return. No autonomous split, replan or auto-next. An already commissioned batch proceeds through its tasks without another owner confirmation at each routine checkpoint.

**Branch guard:** dedicated Change branch/worktree; never switch primary checkout. Run `node scripts/repo-tools/change-branch-guard.mjs --change <ID> --target <reference-branch>` there before edits.

**Parent:** Composer Standard default. Dispatch one substantive task to Composer; up to two children only for proven independent waves. Tiny obvious mechanical edits may be direct. Continue commissioned bounded tasks across internal checkpoints, no repeated approval. Shared-checkout children do not stage/commit. Parent verifies focused checks/diff and commits; heavy acceptance ChatGPT/owner. Stop at IMPLEMENTED — ACCEPTANCE PENDING when required; no premature merge/retirement. [Delegation policy](../../.agents/references/bounded-parent-orchestration.md#0a-budget-first-composer-dispatcher-contract-2026-11-21).

**Child:** one T-ID and direct source/test/contract anchors, decided edit, focused normal/negative check, concise receipt. PATCH/VERIFY or precisely bounded factual investigation; no architecture survey, swarms, paid escalation, unrelated refactors or full suite per child. Local mechanical debugging allowed; report exact contradiction and reproducer.

**Resources:** [owned dev runbook](../../docs/runbooks/dev-worktree-stacks.md); source-only first, no speculative stacks or bypass. Park only own attempted workloads, preserve data/reservations. No paid calls, protected mutation or destruction without explicit authority.

**Resume:** recover current Change/T-ID/receipts, recheck HEAD, worktree, scope, resources and proof. Do not redo finished investigation or trust summary as proof. Report edits, tests/negative, blockers and measured spend if available. [Code quality](../../.agents/rules/code-quality.md).
